<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for signing a Maricopa to ASU Pathways Program agreement — your path to becoming a Sun Devil. Now that you are on a MAPP, you will know exactly which classes you need to complete to make your transition to your desired major at Arizona State University a seamless one.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">As a MAPP student, you have access to ASU’s pathway tracker tool. This tool shows how the classes you have taken will transfer and which classes you still need to take in order to complete the MAPP.&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">The pathway tracker can be found on My ASU under the View My Progress section. You should have access to <a href="https://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a> through <a href="https://my.maricopa.edu/">My Maricopa</a>. Please click on the <b>ASU Alliance</b> link on My Maricopa to access My ASU. You can also access My ASU through <a href="http://www.asu.edu/">asu.edu</a> by using your ASURITE UserID and password.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">If you have any questions about your MAPP or the pathway tracker, please contact your transfer specialist, {!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}, at {!User.Recruiter_Email__c}.</div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!User.FirstName}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Student Transfer Ambassador</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">transferambassadors@asu.edu</div></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>